content.text:
The final change is built and verified. Waiting for your "commit".

**Tests, build, Prettier (run by me):**

```
 Test Files  9 passed (9)
      Tests  94 passed (94)

Application bundle generation complete.   (no warnings)
All matched files use Prettier code style!
```

**Browser render** (headless Chrome, both widths):

| Check | Result |
| --- | --- |
| "Park Finder" | centered in the green header |
| Bar title | white, centered on the brown bar: "Parks" in list mode, the park name in details |
| Back, Recenter, toggle | white icon, transparent fill, 1px white border, all 44px tall |
| Bar bottom padding | 8px |
| Keyboard walk, desktop | Tab → Recenter → Prospect Park → Enter → heading focused with a white ring → Shift+Tab → Back → Enter → link focused |
| Keyboard walk, mobile | same, Shift+Tab from the heading reaches Back in one step |
| Deep link | heading focused once loaded, already reading the park name |
| Text under 16px | none |

Screenshots: `shots/d8-details.png`, `shots/m8-list.png`, `shots/m8-details.png` in the scratchpad.

**How it is structured** (my decision, so the focus logic and its specs stayed put): the panel now renders the brown bar with the heading in the middle and a scrolling body below it. The page projects its three controls into the bar's start and end slots with content projection, and still owns the handlers and sheet state. The old list and details headings collapsed into one heading in the bar, driven by a computed title. "Park not found" is now that title, with "No park matches this link." in the body.

**Diffstat:**

```
 src/app/app.css                  |   1 +
 src/app/panel/park-panel.css     |  43 +++++++-
 src/app/panel/park-panel.html    | 211 ++++++++++++++++++++-------------------
 src/app/panel/park-panel.spec.ts |  18 ++++
 src/app/panel/park-panel.ts      |  24 +++--
 src/app/parks-page.css           |  29 ++----
 src/app/parks-page.html          | 137 +++++++++++++------------
 src/app/parks-page.spec.ts       |  17 ++++
```

The panel template's big line count is re-indentation: the details content moved one level into the new body wrapper. The substantive hunks:

```diff
--- src/app/panel/park-panel.html (top)
+<div class="panel-bar">
+  <div class="slot"><ng-content select="[data-slot='start']" /></div>
+  <h2 id="panel-heading" tabindex="-1" #heading>{{ title() }}</h2>
+  <div class="slot"><ng-content select="[data-slot='end']" /></div>
+</div>
+<div class="panel-body">
   @if (selectedId() === undefined) {
-    <nav aria-labelledby="parks-heading">
-      <h2 id="parks-heading" tabindex="-1" #listHeading>Parks</h2>
+    <nav aria-labelledby="panel-heading">
   …
     @if (selected(); as park) {
       <article>
-        <h2 tabindex="-1" #detailsHeading>{{ park.name }}</h2>
   …
     } @else {
-      <h2 tabindex="-1" #detailsHeading>Park not found</h2>
+      <p>No park matches this link.</p>
     }
+</div>

--- src/app/panel/park-panel.ts
-  private readonly listHeading = viewChild<ElementRef<HTMLHeadingElement>>('listHeading');
-  private readonly detailsHeading = viewChild<ElementRef<HTMLHeadingElement>>('detailsHeading');
+  protected readonly title = computed(() => {
+    const id = this.selectedId();
+    if (id === undefined) return 'Parks';
+    const park = this.selected();
+    if (park) return park.name;
+    return this.loading() || this.error() !== null ? 'Parks' : 'Park not found';
+  });
+  private readonly heading = viewChild.required<ElementRef<HTMLHeadingElement>>('heading');
   …
-        if (id !== this.lastFocusedId && detailsHeading) {
-          detailsHeading.nativeElement.focus();
+        if (id !== this.lastFocusedId && !this.loading()) {
+          heading.nativeElement.focus();
   …
-      const target = link?.nativeElement ?? listHeading?.nativeElement;
+      const target = link?.nativeElement ?? heading.nativeElement;

--- src/app/panel/park-panel.css
 :host {
-  display: block;
+  display: flex;
+  flex-direction: column;
+  height: 100%;
+  min-height: 0;
 }
+.panel-bar { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr 44px; align-items: center;
+  gap: var(--space-2); padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); background: var(--color-secondary); }
+.slot { display: flex; }
+.slot:last-child { justify-content: flex-end; }
+.panel-bar h2 { margin: 0; color: var(--color-surface); font-size: 1.1rem; text-align: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
+/* The tertiary ring is about 2.1:1 on the brown bar … white is 13:1. */
+.panel-bar :focus-visible { outline-color: var(--color-surface); }
-h2 { margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); color: var(--color-primary); }
+.panel-body { flex: 1; min-height: 0; padding: var(--space-3); overflow-y: auto; }

--- src/app/parks-page.html
 <main #sheet [class.is-expanded]="expanded()">
-  <div class="panel-bar"> …controls… </div>
   <div id="sheet" class="sheet-content">
-    <app-park-panel … />
+    <app-park-panel …>
+      @if (id() !== undefined) { <a data-slot="start" class="back" …>…</a> }
+      @else { <button data-slot="start" class="recenter" …>…</button> }
+      @if (isMobile()) { <button data-slot="end" class="sheet-toggle" …>…</button> }
+    </app-park-panel>
   </div>

